{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6f117024-88e0-8850-a16c-df84d53370bb",
  "created_at": "2026-01-06T09:02:59-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Beverly Sherman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T08:59:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T08:59:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. Um, this is Beverly Sherman. I'm calling about the water and sewer bill for a rental I own, one fourteen Old Beach Road, down by Easton's Beach."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T09:00:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Ms. Sherman. What's going on with the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T09:00:11-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it's wicked high. Three times what it ought to be. We had a pipe break in the cellar back in November, [line breaks up] and I had a plumber fix it right away, but the meter ran the whole time, and I'm not paying for water that went into the ground."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T09:00:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you cut out for a second. You had a broken pipe in the basement in November, and it was repaired?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T09:00:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Repaired, yes, the same week. I have the plumber's invoice. So is there a leak adjustment, or whatever you call it? Somebody told me there was such a thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T09:00:46-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there's a review process for leak adjustments. You'd submit the repair invoice and the account is looked at against your usual usage. I can start that request for you. Can I have the name on the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T09:00:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's the thing. It's in my husband's name. Walter. He passed, and I never did get it changed over. I'm the owner now, though. I'm the one paying it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T09:01:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. Spell his last name for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T09:01:12-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "S-H-E-R-M-A-N. Same as mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T09:01:14-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I see the account at that address. We'll want to update the name to yours, and I can note that now. You'd need to send in something showing you're the owner, and the invoice for the repair."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T09:01:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. I've got the deed somewhere. I'll tell you, I was nervous about making this call. I figured I'd get the runaround."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T09:01:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No runaround. I'll put the adjustment request in the notes so it's tied to the account. Do you have an email, or would you rather drop the papers off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T09:01:45-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll bring them in. I don't do the computer much. Now, another thing. I work till late, and you close at four thirty, don't you? Is there any way to pay by phone after four thirty? Or any other way when the office is shut?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T09:01:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. There's an online payment option you can use any hour. And there's a drop box at City Hall for checks outside office hours. If you'd rather pay by phone, there's an automated line, and I can give you that before we hang up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T09:02:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, the drop box will do. I write a check anyway. Do I put the account number on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T09:02:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, write the account number on the memo line, so it posts to the right place. And I'd pay the undisputed part while the review is pending."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T09:02:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. I suppose that's sensible. I don't love it, but all right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T09:02:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Can I confirm a callback number in case I have a question about the invoice?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T09:02:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's four oh one, five five five, oh one five three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T09:02:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one five three. Got it. Bring the papers to the utilities window and ask for me or whoever's on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T09:02:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll do that this week. Thank you, dear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T09:02:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Sherman. Have a good day."
    }
  ],
